## SQ-CBM-01 | CB startup pack
@group A
@commands `grep -E "Error\|creativebrewing\|potion_area\|Tool Effects\|\[alcohol\]\|\[food values\]\|CE potions" logs/kubejs/startup.log \| head -40`
@pass CB pack lists `creativeengineering/potions.js` ... `vinery/winemaker_trades.js`; `[alcohol] food values set on 44 of 44 drinks` (as before the move); `[food values] 12 effect swaps`; no `could not install dispenser handler`; no `global.trades missing`
@fails A moved startup file reads a pack top-level name at load (4.1 rule 3), or a renamed Java class (PotionBucketDispenser, DragonBreathBrewing, WinemakerTrades) is not in the CB jar
@from batches/r1101/cs4_boot3.qb
shell grep -E "Error|creativebrewing\]|potion_area|Tool Effects|\[alcohol\]|\[food values\]|CE potions|could not install|global.trades missing|jar-startup" logs/kubejs/startup.log | cut -c1-220 | head -40
kjsreject could not install dispenser handler
kjsreject global\.trades missing
look CB pack lists its startup files; [alcohol] food values set on 44 of 44 drinks; [food values] 12 effect swaps

## SQ-CBM-02 | CB-registered items, effect, potion
@group A
@commands Same boot: `/give` `creativeengineering:potion_bucket`, `creativeengineering:magic_resistance` via `/effect give`, a `minecraft:potion{Potion:"creativeengineering:long_reach"}`
@pass Items, effect and potion exist (registered from the CB startup pack)
@fails Registry callbacks from jar packs not fired
@from batches/r1101/cs4_boot3.qb passed
# judge-3, 2026-11-18: ids follow the owning jar since 2026-11-09 (potion bucket creativebrewing:, potions and effect
# creativecommon:); the qa bot came from the lost cs4_boot3 setup row, spawned here at the flat-world origin
> execute unless entity qa run pbot spawn qa 0 -60 0 minecraft:overworld survival
sleep 3
> give qa creativebrewing:potion_bucket
> effect give qa creativecommon:magic_resistance 10
> give qa minecraft:potion{Potion:"creativecommon:long_reach"}
reject Unknown (item|effect)
expect Applied effect
expect Gave 1 +\[.*\] to qa

## SQ-CBM-03 | CB recipes and ids
@group A
@commands Same boot: `grep -E "potion bottling done\|tipped arrow\|alcohol recipes\|jeed_providers.js:" logs/kubejs/server.log`; `/kubejs dump_recipes`-style check or `/recipe` count of `creativebrewing:` ids
@pass Same recipe counts as before the move; recipe ids now `creativebrewing:<type>/...` (were `creativeengineering:`); Brewin' upstream ids (`brewinandchewin:fermenting/beer_from_water` ...) still removed
@fails `global.CB.recipes` missing, or a removal ran after its own add
@from batches/r1101/cs4_boot3.qb
@reviewed 2026-11-16
shell grep -E "potion bottling done|tipped arrow|alcohol recipes|jeed_providers.js:" logs/kubejs/server.log | cut -c1-200 | head -10
> cdevtest recipes creativebrewing: max=1
waitlog \[cdevtest\] verb=recipes text=creativebrewing: n= 30
expect \[cdevtest\] verb=recipes text=creativebrewing: n=[1-9]\d* 
> cdevtest recipes brewinandchewin:fermenting/beer_from_water
waitlog \[cdevtest\] verb=recipes text=brewinandchewin:fermenting/beer_from_water n= 30
expect \[cdevtest\] verb=recipes text=brewinandchewin:fermenting/beer_from_water n=0 
reject \[cdevtest\] .*(done=0|error=)
look bottling 1710, tipped 94 x 2 as in boot 2; the `verb=recipes text=creativebrewing:` count is the CB recipe total (compare with the last dump); ids creativebrewing:<type>/...

