kjsexpect \[wandering trades\] winemaker [1-9]\d

## SQ-CBM-05 | CB fluid tags
@group A
@commands Same boot: `/dumptags` fluid `forge:fluid/potion`, `forge:fluid/dragon_breath`
@pass `create:potion` in the first, IE's potion fluid not; dragon's breath in the second
@fails CB fluid tag script not loaded
@from batches/r1101/cs4_boot3.qb
> dumptags
waitlog (dumptags|tags).*(done|written|wrote) 300
shell python3 -c "import json;d=json.load(open('kubejs/exported/tags/fluid_tags.json'));print({k:v for k,v in d.items() if k in ('forge:fluid/potion','forge:fluid/dragon_breath','forge:potion')})" 2>&1 | cut -c1-600
look create:potion in forge:fluid/potion, IE potion fluid not; dragon's breath in the second

## SQ-CBM-06 | tool and armor effects
@group A
@commands Same boot: hold a dragon sword (tool effects) and wear the echo armor set (armor effects) for 5 s; `/data get entity @p ActiveEffects`
@pass Held and set effects applied as before
@fails `global.armorEffects` / `toolEffects` missing in the CB server pack
@from batches/r1101/cs4_boot3.qb
> effect clear qa
> item replace entity qa weapon.mainhand with dragonloot:dragon_sword
> item replace entity qa armor.head with create_deep_dark:echo_armor_helmet
> item replace entity qa armor.chest with create_deep_dark:echo_armor_chestplate
> item replace entity qa armor.legs with create_deep_dark:echo_armor_leggings
> item replace entity qa armor.feet with create_deep_dark:echo_armor_boots
sleep 8
> data get entity qa ActiveEffects
look held and set effects present (compare tool_effects / armor_effects rows for the two)

